90Z","roundId":"group_bg_1776763562471_1qey7xh","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1775848827498","_id":3972},{"id":1776763562497.857,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"4edbaa93-9a90-492c-9b31-50108407a1cb","senderName":"秦海一","text":"按封岳说的做。另外，傍晚市局的王副局会在‘品茗阁’喝茶。封岳，你替我走一趟，把我书房那盒绝版的古巴雪茄带过去。告诉他，桐城的新规矩，会让他很满意。","timestamp":"2026-04-21T09:26:02.497Z","roundId":"group_bg_1776763562471_1qey7xh","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1775848827498","_id":3973},{"id":1776767193978.262,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"76e09228-1322-4aa8-89e1-10798893f2dc","senderName":"齐硕","text":"妈的饿死老子了，城东这边连个像样的大排档都没开门，全被昨天那阵仗吓得不敢出摊。","timestamp":"2026-04-21T10:26:33.978Z","roundId":"group_bg_1776767193978_1lu082c","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1775922794651","_id":3981},{"id":1776767194014.7812,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"f0183f8f-6499-4851-b940-d9124e251388","senderName":"梁悍宇","text":"活该，让你满大街瞎晃。老子正准备吃饭，吃完还有活要干。","timestamp":"2026-04-21T10:26:34.014Z","roundId":"group_bg_1776767193978_1lu082c","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1775922794651","_id":3982},{"id":1776767194033.879,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"76e09228-1322-4aa8-89e1-10798893f2dc","senderName":"齐硕","text":"操，你现在是真滋润，天天有人给做饭。堂主，晚上真不用我带几个兄弟去韩宁那几个旧场子镇场？我怕有不长眼的小鬼闹事。","timestamp":"2026-04-21T10:26:34.033Z","roundId":"group_bg_1776767193978_1lu082c","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1775922794651","_id":3983},{"id":1776767194047.6196,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"9265fb69-350e-4915-a5ee-e3b1809eafd4","senderName":"厉子宁","text":"不用。韩宁剩下的那几个心腹，悍宇今晚会处理干净。你吃完饭带着人老实待着，别在这个节骨眼上生事。","timestamp":"2026-04-21T10:26:34.047Z","roundId":"group_bg_1776767193978_1lu082c","isBackgroundMsg":true,"userId":"uid_1775062871786_o923av1ev","characterId":"group_1775922794651","_id":3984},{"id":1776767194061.6853,